<p>The dataset was first cleaned by removing observations with missing values for price, country, variety, and province to ensure that all variables used in the analysis were complete. We then selected only the relevant variables and removed the 100 most expensive wines, as these extreme price outliers were disproportionately inflating the mean price and distorting comparisons across countries and varieties.</p>
